{"_meta":{"source":"Yahoo Finance via yfinance (profile, statements, analyst estimates)","fetched_at":"2026-10-28T16:56:41+00:00","status":"ok","error":null,"last_success":"2026-10-28T16:56:41+00:00"},"data":{"profile":{"name":"Kempower Oyj","sector":"Industrials","industry":"Electrical Equipment & Parts","country":"Finland","city":"Lahti","website":"https://kempower.com","employees":772,"summary":"Kempower Oyj manufactures and sells electric vehicle (EV) charging equipment and solutions for cars, buses, trucks, boats, aviation, and machinery in Nordics, rest of Europe, North America, and internationally. The company offers distributed EV charging systems, such as satellite, liquid-cooled satellite, control unit, pantograph up and down, cable arm, and mega satellite; and standalone EV charges, including station charger under the Kempower brand. It also provides ChargEye, a cloud-based charging management system for electric bus and depots, developers, and CPOs and retail. Additionally, the company offers training; maintenance and support; modernization and upgrades; and consulting and design services. It serves public charging, logistics, public transportation, marine, and port industries. Kempower Oyj was founded in 1949 and is headquartered in Lahti, Finland.","exchange":"Helsinki","currency":"EUR","financial_currency":"EUR","summary_fr":"Kempower Oyj fabrique et vend des équipements et des solutions de recharge de véhicules électriques pour les voitures, les bus, les camions, les bateaux, l'aviation et les machines dans les pays nordiques, le reste de l'Europe, l'Amérique du Nord et à l'international. La société propose des systèmes de charge EV distribués, tels que le satellite, le satellite à refroidissement liquide, l'unité de contrôle, le pantographe haut et bas, le bras de câble et le méga satellite; et des charges EV autonomes, y compris le chargeur de station sous la marque Kempower. Il fournit également ChargEye, un système de gestion de charge basé sur l